    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Side by side (panel D), the fitted composites trace the flask and globular Lagena closely and visibly fail on the slender spindles, which is the honest result of the test. But the only 'specimens' in Pass 1 are 1917 line drawings after Brady; the vendored CC-BY photograph (Kireenko 2022) is not analysed, so no real specimen has been compared yet." ;
